atrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{(-2)\\cdot (-3)-2\\cdot 2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102705" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "924c7aa0a2799399d689ea46bce23b695fb145fe4235247d2d1a84c5d90c53a4"} {"question" "q-102705" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102705" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=2[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102705" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102808" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following represents the solution to the system of linear equations given below?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-3=y \\\\ 3y=4x+2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102808" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-y=3 \\\\ -4x+3y=2.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}].$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{2\\cdot 3-(-4)\\cdot (-1)}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102808" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "924c7aa0a2799399d689ea46bce23b695fb145fe4235247d2d1a84c5d90c53a4"} {"question" "q-102808" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e5d1f1c51d7a1de2d529f4b6ef38cefe32e6d536e5cb78261131e6234cc5abb"} {"question" "q-102808" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=-\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063974/state.json" "file_sha2